WEBVTT

NOTE These follow the pitch's own chapter lines, which are also the words on screen.

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.800
Your numbers know the answers.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.800
So why does one question take days?

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.800
Ask in plain English.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.800
Writes the SQL. Runs it. Draws the chart.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:31.800
Now ask why: it finds what drove it.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:41.800
Spots what's off.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:47.800
Shows its working. Read-only. Says when the data can't answer.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:59.500
Ask the numbers. Get the answer, the chart and the reason why.
